PS5SX3's own tuning of Grand Theft Auto IV (Europe), BLES00229 with its update 01.08.
The same executable as NPEB00882 with its update 01.09 (PPU-a2c90aafce24744d5ac6da8ad009ce301458c8a7): the same addresses.
On by default (the title's cheats/on_by_default.tsv); the home menu's Cheats turns each off, and off stays off.
Made by a tool from the Freeze values of PS5SX3's ps5-defaults.yml (TB8), not typed.
